    confidence 4 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
    comment "en" """
        Swedish 5th-char extension of D86.3 (sarcoidosis of skin); the successor is the skin-morphology
        concept 4266327 (400127001, sarcoidal granuloma of skin), slightly narrower than the Swedish
